[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764716487","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100320#issuecomment-2764716487","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100320","id":2764716487,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyjnH","user":{"login":"oxeron","id":587942,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4Nzk0Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/587942?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron","html_url":"https://github.com/oxeron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T19:46:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T19:46:28Z","body":"Hello, I have the same issue but with an NavigationObstacle2D child (my scene does not have an AudioStreamPlayer Child) The error you mentioned displayed in the console log  with Godot 4.4.1.stable\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6c65126-5cbd-4d96-9ec8-e4046cfe6870)\n\n> E 0:00:02:030   can_process: Condition \"!is_inside_tree()\" is true. Returning: false\n>   <C++ Source>  scene/main/node.cpp:867 @ can_process()\n\nI tried moving VisibilityEnabler2D behind NavigationObstacle2D and the error disappear\n\nAnother test I did:\nI recreated an instanced scene in my test project and the error disappears too:\n\nNo error:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56ddc402-96f9-4121-b12e-acde34255932)\n\nError is displayed:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64286d0c-63c8-4893-ad05-07f545c6337b)\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764716487/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508502098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100320#issuecomment-3508502098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100320","id":3508502098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RH35S","user":{"login":"naturally-intelligent","id":6783606,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODM2MDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6783606?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent","html_url":"https://github.com/naturally-intelligent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T16:30:58Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T18:39:10Z","body":"Can confirm this.\n\nRelated to: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112477","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508502098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3751321130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100320#issuecomment-3751321130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100320","id":3751321130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fmJ4q","user":{"login":"sigmund68k","id":9064423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNjQ0MjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9064423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmund68k","html_url":"https://github.com/sigmund68k","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmund68k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmund68k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmund68k/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmund68k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmund68k/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmund68k/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmund68k/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmund68k/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmund68k/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T19:45:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T19:45:16Z","body":"> NavigationObstacle2D\n\nI believe NavigationObstacle2D will exhibit the same error behavior as AudioStreamPlayer2D.  Here's the C++ code from NavigationObstacle2D::_notification:\n\n`\nvoid NavigationObstacle2D::_notification(int p_what) {\n\tswitch (p_what) {\n\n\t\t// Other cases deleted...\n\n\t\tcase NOTIFICATION_SUSPENDED:\n\t\tcase NOTIFICATION_PAUSED: {\n\t\t\tif (!can_process()) {\n\t\t\t\tmap_before_pause = map_current;\n\t\t\t\t_update_map(RID());\n\t\t\t} else if (can_process() && !(map_before_pause == RID())) {\n\t\t\t\t_update_map(map_before_pause);\n\t\t\t\tmap_before_pause = RID();\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tNavigationServer2D::get_singleton()->obstacle_set_paused(obstacle, !can_process());\n\t\t} break;\n\n\t\t// Other cases deleted...\n\n\t}\n}\n`\n\nThe \"NOTIFICATION_PAUSED\" will be sent to the NavigationObstacle2D indirectly from the VisibleOnScreenEnabler2D when it's added to the tree.  This results the call to can_process() before the NavigationObstacle2D is on the tree.  \n\nDepending on how (if?) this is addressed, the fix could address both.  Or it would at least be a similar fix.  See more details in #112477 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3751321130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]